By then you should be tough enough to deal with water demons/nymphs/
moccasins, so start going for fountain wishes from DL1 on down
(careful in Minetown).

Bones files (esp. wizard's bones) are also a common source of MR.
Wands or other sources of polymorph can be used on amulets/cloaks.
Use polymorph traps to get a pet gray or silver dragon in the hopes
that it'll leave scales when it dies.

Alternatively, dive for the castle (dig down with pick-axe or wand of
digging); once you have reflection/MR you can more safely go back and
explore levels fully.  Limiting your exposure to instadeaths is one of
the huge keys to ascending at a high rate.


